统计 "red blue red" 中每个单词出现次数并输出字典。

统计 "red blue red"，输出 {"red": 2, "blue": 1}

nodes.solution:
text = "red blue red"
counts = {}
for w in text.split():
    counts[w] = counts.get(w, 0) + 1
print(counts)
